MiniMax-H3
----------
vllm_omni_neuron/diffusion/models/minimax_h3/ and
vllm_omni_neuron/diffusion/distributed/autoencoders/autoencoder_kl_minimax_h3.py,
autoencoder_minimax_h3_audio.py are Neuron ports of the MiniMax-H3 modeling code in
Hugging Face diffusers (https://github.com/huggingface/diffusers, Apache License 2.0):
models/transformers/transformer_minimax_h3.py, models/autoencoders/autoencoder_kl_minimax_h3*.py,
schedulers/scheduling_minimax_h3.py and modular_pipelines/minimax_h3/, as of diffusers main in
2026-09. The departures from the reference are documented in each module's docstring.
